  "answer_text": "Here's an overview of **ProFed Credit Union** based on available information:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfe6 ProFed Credit Union\n\n**Website:** [profedcu.org](https://www.profedcu.org)\n\n### About\nFounded in 1933, ProFed Credit Union is a **$740 million financial cooperative** with nearly **66,000 member-owners**. It provides financial services to members and businesses all over **Northeast Indiana**.\n\n---\n\n### Membership\nYou can own a piece of the credit union with just **$5**. Membership gets you exclusive access to **lower fees and competitive rates**, plus local, personalized service, discounted perks, and a cooperative that supports your community.\n\nYou are eligible to join if you **live, work, worship, attend school, volunteer, or regularly conduct business** in Adams, Allen, DeKalb, Huntington, LaGrange, Noble, Steuben, Wells, and Whitley counties.\n\n---\n\n### Branches & Locations\nProFed has **13 branch locations** in northeast Indiana. Branches are located in communities including **Fort Wayne, Auburn, Decatur, New Haven, Bluffton, Angola, and Columbia City**.\n\n---\n\n### Services & Resources\nProFed offers a wide range of resources for **kids, adults, and businesses** to help members become empowered on their financial journey \u2014 from budgeting basics to investing and planning for retirement.\n\nThey also offer flexible appointment options, allowing you to book a time for an **in-person or virtual meeting** in minutes.\n\n---\n\n### Scholarships\nQualifying students can apply for a **$2,500 ProFed scholarship** to help with college expenses.\n\n---\n\n### Social Media\n- \ud83d\udcd8 **Facebook:** ProFed Credit Union (Fort Wayne, IN)\n- \ud83d\udcf8 **Instagram:** @profedcreditunion\n- \ud83d\udcbc **LinkedIn:** ProFed Credit Union\n\n---\n\nIs there something specific about ProFed Credit Union you'd like to know more about, such as loan products, account types, or how to join?",
